</ul><h1>Not Sauce</h1><p>You know those flame-less candles you see sometimes, with the big bulb on top and the obviously fake plastic “wax” dripping down the side? Well, these aren’t those. Because the wax? It’s real. But the flame? It’s not. Which is how you end up with faux candles that look super realistic.</p>
<p>Like, for example, these red, textured ones:</p>
<p><img height="500" src="https://media.stores.com/mediocre/image/upload/v1784552938/red_candles_enfmhk.jpg" width="500" /></p>
<p>In some ways, it’s the best of both worlds, isn’t it? They’re modern. They’re easy to turn on and off with the included remote. They provide real ambiance without being fire hazard. Nice, right?</p>
<p>And did we mention that the technology behind these candles was created by Disney Imagineers for use in the Haunted Mansion? Pretty cool, huh? What’s more, they’re–</p>
